The paper’s main theorem is existential, but its proof is an absorbing construction; the native witness is an ordered loose cycle, checked by exact set intersections and coverage. I’m now checking whether the dense degree regime has a genuinely efficient constructive algorithm, because that decides whether the honest label is Track B or whether a Track A distribution is defensible.
