codex
All local gates pass: 0/200,000 structured guesses, four attacks at 0/8, the reference algorithm at 8/8 with a mean 4.73 million color evaluations (33.1 million counted modular operations), 100/100 canonical-symmetry checks, and a 252-operation compact route. The required oracle service is externally blocked: a fresh run again returned HTTP 403 “Key limit exceeded” on every retry, which correctly provides no hardness verdict.
