codex
The final local design is now verified: five simultaneous native loose-path connectors, 0/200,000 structured guesses, four attacks at 0/8, reference scan 8/8 at 1.40 million colour tests and 26.5 million counted operations, 100/100 symmetry checks, and a 105-operation compact route. Only the mandated external oracle/G9 evidence remains unavailable because the supplied OpenRouter key is quota-blocked.
