Deliverables:

- [gen_1603_04180.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1603.04180/gen_1603_04180.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1603.04180/selftest_report.json)
- [README.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1603.04180/README.md)
- [llm_loop_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1603.04180/llm_loop_transcript.jsonl)
- [g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1603.04180/g9_hinted_transcript.jsonl)
- [g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1603.04180/g9_placebo_transcript.jsonl)

Local gates all pass:

- 12/12 planted and theorem-condition checks
- 0/200,000 random candidates
- Four attacks at 0/8
- Reference scan succeeds 8/8, averaging 26.5 million operations
- 100/100 canonical relabelling checks
- Ten answer atoms, 246 characters
- Compact route: 105 exact operations

The only blocker is external: every required hardening and G9 oracle call returned OpenRouter HTTP 403, “Key limit exceeded.” The transcripts preserve these errors, but they are not valid hardness evidence. The result is therefore not submission-ready until the OpenRouter quota is restored and the three harness runs are repeated.
